								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16797#msg16797">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2850 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 11:15:26 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16795#msg16795">Quote from: Carsonn on May 03, 2005, 11:08:52 am</a></div><div class="quote">What guild are you in ?  Just curious to see.  So please tell me how my having improper grammar going to land me in prison?  I have to here this.<br /></div><br />sheesh, i was kidding. It was just humor even if it was poorly presented. I&#039;m not in a guild. I have no affiliation with any of the guilds currently arguing over Coirnav. Chill out a tad.
						</td>
