							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16789#msg16789">Quote from: Shakro on May 03, 2005, 10:22:52 am</a></div><div class="quote">I can&#039;t believe UoP members don&#039;t know their guild&#039;s own history.&nbsp; True, you guys posting are probably newer, and were in different guilds back then, but RN is an old server, and guild reputations tend to linger perhaps longer than is deserved.<br /></div><br />You know, when I joined, I was supposed to get a packet in the mail with helpful information like officer profiles, likes/dislikes, guild history and an educational video about raiding. And can you believe it? Packet got lost in the mail or something..
