								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16805#msg16805"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16805#msg16805">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2856 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 01:05:08 pm &#187;</span></td>
