								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							You know, when I joined, I was supposed to get a packet in the mail with helpful information like officer profiles, likes/dislikes, guild history and an educational video about raiding. And can you believe it? Packet got lost in the mail or something..<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"></div><br />Then dont try to act all innocent about, UoP did it too.&nbsp; UoP had CoH mages camped in every single area of VT.&nbsp; It was &quot;permacamped&quot;&nbsp; Others guilds didnt even have a chance.<br /><br /><br />All we did was something that has been done since PoP came out.&nbsp; And pretty much every guild that does this content on every server will still do it, til eq dies completly.<br /><br />You guys will get your chance, just like we had to wait to get ours.<br /><br />Yeesh<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
