	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16809"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868" title="View the profile of Shrek">Shrek</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 22<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16809#msg16809"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16809#msg16809">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2859 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 03:28:06 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The concept that because we&#039;re retired from EQ makes our opinions invalid is funny.<br /><br />We did this content 2+ years ago that your doing now, it&#039;s not like we don&#039;t know what we&#039;re talking about.<br /><br />Hell, while DA/EiE were Time flagging, Ascent did a backflag event, and ended up blowing a Coirnav.&nbsp; The encounter had been changed and their old strat didn&#039;t work right.&nbsp; We sure as hell didn&#039;t want to lose the next 6days for them to flag 20 or so people, and possibly even longer.&nbsp; They sent their applicants and some members along and got their flags.<br /><br />Cock-blocking and being an ass has it&#039;s place, but when it doesn&#039;t benefit any of you ... well that&#039;s just retarded... unless of course it gets you a chubby.&nbsp; If you find it entertaining then go for it.<br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
