						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16811#msg16811"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16811#msg16811">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2860 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:06:45 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br />What I don&#039;t understand is, why does UoP need the fish again?  Surely you have everyone FR, Xeg, TRC flagged by now.  That means that entire force you used to kill Coirnav the first time is surely now time flagged.  Should be at least 55 people or so, right?  That&#039;s plenty to begin farming time with, considering you can 83/17 another 10 to 12 and then begin to backflag them all with the key that drops in time.  Seems alot easier to do imo, unless you had alot of people leave the guild after that Coir kill... but it&#039;s your decision what mobs you go after.  I wish yall luck with the spawn and the kill.<br /><br /><br />UoP has 100+ active raiders we need more then 1 ele god kill on each for flag some people cant attend all of our raids and miss some flags, we do them twice to make it fair to them we have about 50 time flagged people i think it is now with 1 more coir kill we should be at 70+
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16812"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
