								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16812#msg16812"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16812#msg16812">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2861 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:08:12 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16808#msg16808">Quote from: Self Destruction on May 03, 2005, 02:53:37 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16807#msg16807">Quote from: matteo on May 03, 2005, 02:05:08 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Just a suggestion...  Why don&#039;t you guys grow the fuck up and just do a joint Coirnav raid.  36 flags to each guild.  Fighting over a mob from 4 expansions ago is pretty damn idiotic.  <br /></div><br />Sweet, another &#039;it&#039;s not cutting edge, it&#039;s trivial&#039; retired troll. Here&#039;s a suggestion for you. Why don&#039;t you go post suggestions for the game you actually play where people might give a crap? ...and take Toastie with you.<br /><br /><br /></div><br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Golden
						</td>
