	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16813"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1036" title="View the profile of Mizin">Mizin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 47<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1036"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:acervasio@verizon.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16813#msg16813"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16813#msg16813">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2862 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:09:25 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br /><br /><br />Just a suggestion...  Why don&#039;t you guys grow the fuck up and just do a joint Coirnav raid.  36 flags to each guild.  <b>Fighting over a mob from 4 expansions ago is pretty damn idiotic.&nbsp; </b> <br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"></div><br />there is always new guilds and as long as there is new guilds there will be competition for progression mobs... and for 36 of each guild, it would be very difficult getting one guild to listen to anonther and pointing a raid leader who leads the heal chain etc... it would be hell
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16815"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1052" title="View the profile of Gixxdinree">Gixxdinree</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 6<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1052"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16815#msg16815"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16815#msg16815">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2863 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:22:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Diplomacy was tried between the leaders.  An agreement could not be reached.  However since everyone had the policy of killing it when it was up regardless of who needed it for what... thus blocking each other from it... Wari took matters into his own hands because IL could not get the mob on their time... I don’t agree with the tactics, in fact I almost didn’t raid that night, but what’s done is done and IL will NOT go after that mob again.. IL wanted only ONE kill of that particular mob (most mobs we like 2 but 2 wasn’t worth the hassle for this mob) and to make sure we didn’t need to even attempt it again, we invited everyone we could that was willing to come… even an OA member or 2.<br /><br />OA had every right to go after that mob when it was up, it wasn’t very…err…nice.. I guess.. of them to do that when there are other things they need besides Corinav to progress and other guilds only need that mob, but that doesn’t put them in the wrong.<br /><br />UoP had the same right and they need that mob to progress immediately, but they already had a kill... still they had the right.<br /><br />IL also had the same right to go after it, but it was seldom on their time, and when it was, it was on an off night when it is difficult to gather the players/classes needed to kill that mob which made them frustrated.  So they did something kinda shady to get it on their time… we got our kill, we wont take Corinav again, I hope you don’t hold it against IL for being frustrated with the whole situation and taking matters into their own hands.<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">We did this content 2+ years ago that your doing now, it&#039;s not like we don&#039;t know what we&#039;re talking about</div><br />Well were doing it now, and some things have changed again. Something that is trivial to you might not be so trivial to us. And what worked for you doesn&#039;t nessicaraly work for us.&nbsp; Strat help is fine, encuragement is fine, telling us how to run our guilds is not.<br /><br />--Gixxdinree<br />--Offcer of Inner Loop<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 03, 2005, 04:25:49 pm by Gixxdinree</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16816"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 105<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								With Teeth<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16816#msg16816"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16816#msg16816">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2864 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:24:19 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16809#msg16809">Quote from: Shrek on May 03, 2005, 03:28:06 pm</a></div><div class="quote">The concept that because we&#039;re retired from EQ makes our opinions invalid is funny.<br /></div><br />No, what&#039;s really funny is that I didn&#039;t comment at all about how valid his opinion was or not, but you can&#039;t read. Now that&#039;s amusing, good sir! Oh, ha ha...jolly good!<br /><br />I simply said I didn&#039;t give a crap about his retired, trolling opinion...just like I don&#039;t give a crap about your retired, trolling opinion. I, and probably the majority of the mid-level raiders on this board, am just plain tired of the constant condescending attitude that your type constantly spew. Toastie&#039;s posts, for example, are about as useful as a case of the clap and serve no other purpose other than to belittle the majority of the people who still play on RN and to inflate his own, apparently very very needy, ego.<br /><br />And while I&#039;m passing out suggestions, I&#039;ll be generous enough to issue you a copy of the suggestion I gave Matteo. Take your condescending opinions and shove them....straight up your ass. Here...have a stick <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/poke.gif" alt="poke" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Virsig1.png" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=859121" target="_blank"><font size="4">Fateseer Virulence</font></a><br /><b>the Plague 70 Prophet</b>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
